WEBVTT

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:15.027
Monster House Chapter 1 Do you want to die?

00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:19.620
It was the afternoon before Halloween.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.394
A little girl was on her bike in Oak Street in Mayville.

00:00:24.454 --> 00:00:29.198
She went happily between the trees and the lovely gardens.

00:00:29.258 --> 00:00:34.683
But then her bike went on to a front lawn and she stopped.

00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:38.820
There was a strange sound and she looked up.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.676
The lawn was in front of a big old house.

00:00:42.736 --> 00:00:46.467
There were two windows over the front door.

00:00:46.527 --> 00:00:49.898
The windows looked down at her angrily.

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:55.090
There was a loud shout, and an old man came out of the house.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.741
It was Mr. Nebbercracker.

00:00:57.801 --> 00:01:00.112
Get off my lawn!

00:01:00.172 --> 00:01:04.092
He shouted, do you want to die?

00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:08.253
The little girl was frightened and she ran away.

00:01:08.313 --> 00:01:12.967
Mr. Nebbercracker walked across the lawn and took the bike.

00:01:13.027 --> 00:01:15.610
And don't come back!

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:20.804
These children, he said, they never listen.

00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:23.517
The sound came again.

00:01:23.576 --> 00:01:27.090
It was louder and then it stopped.

00:01:27.149 --> 00:01:32.320
Mr. Nebbercracker went into his house and closed the door.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:37.350
DJ Walters lived opposite Mr. Nebbercracker's house.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:42.023
DJ saw everything and wrote about it in his book.

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:45.226
There was a lot of writing in the book.

00:01:45.286 --> 00:01:52.100
Today he wrote, 30th October, End took bike.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:57.028
DJ, his mum called, I'm coming!

00:01:57.088 --> 00:02:01.064
DJ looked at the pictures on the walls of his bedroom.

00:02:01.124 --> 00:02:04.758
They were photos of Mr. Nebbercracker's house.

00:02:04.818 --> 00:02:08.412
DJ, she called again.

00:02:08.471 --> 00:02:11.264
DJ ran out of his house.

00:02:11.324 --> 00:02:13.926
His mom and dad were in the car.

00:02:13.986 --> 00:02:16.198
Mom, said DJ.

00:02:16.258 --> 00:02:18.334
He took a bike again.

00:02:18.394 --> 00:02:29.266
DJ, she said, you can't stay in your room for hours to watch an old man, but there's something wrong with that house.

00:02:29.325 --> 00:02:32.268
We're going, said his dad.

00:02:32.328 --> 00:02:34.300
Zee is coming soon.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.902
She's staying with you tonight.

00:02:36.962 --> 00:02:42.166
We love you, called his mom, and they drove away.

00:02:42.226 --> 00:02:46.602
Then a boy with a ball came across the street.

00:02:46.662 --> 00:02:50.925
It was Chowder, DJ's best friend.

00:02:50.985 --> 00:02:55.159
It's Halloween soon, said Chowder.

00:02:55.219 --> 00:02:57.662
What are you going to wear?

00:02:57.722 --> 00:03:02.366
I'm not going trick or treating this year, said DJ.

00:03:02.426 --> 00:03:05.239
But we always do.

00:03:05.298 --> 00:03:07.880
We're too old now.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:12.562
Chowder tried to throw his ball into the basket on the wall.

00:03:12.622 --> 00:03:15.152
He turned and looked at DJ.

00:03:15.212 --> 00:03:16.613
Be careful!

00:03:16.673 --> 00:03:18.344
Chowder DJ.

00:03:18.404 --> 00:03:22.014
Chowder turned back and the ball hit him.

00:03:22.074 --> 00:03:23.215
Ah!

00:03:23.275 --> 00:03:26.176
Chowder put his hand on his nose.

00:03:26.236 --> 00:03:27.927
Are you okay?

00:03:27.987 --> 00:03:29.548
Ask DJ.

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:31.968
Then he saw the ball.

00:03:32.028 --> 00:03:33.749
Oh no!

00:03:33.809 --> 00:03:37.480
It was on Mr. Nevercracker's nice lawn.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:42.442
Your older DJ, you get it, said Chowder.

00:03:42.502 --> 00:03:44.853
No, said DJ.

00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:47.334
But it was expensive.

00:03:47.394 --> 00:03:51.096
Maybe Mr. Nebakracker is sleeping.

00:03:51.156 --> 00:03:53.497
DJ looked at the house.

00:03:53.556 --> 00:03:55.257
Okay.

00:03:55.317 --> 00:03:58.098
He put one foot on the lawn.

00:03:58.158 --> 00:03:59.979
The ball was close.

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:01.740
He ran to it.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.132
Suddenly the door opened and Mr. Nebakracker came out.

00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:07.302
You!

00:04:07.362 --> 00:04:09.374
DJ moved quickly.

00:04:09.434 --> 00:04:12.106
His shoe pulled out a bit of the lawn.

00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:13.348
I'm sorry!

00:04:13.408 --> 00:04:14.749
cried DJ.

00:04:14.809 --> 00:04:19.434
He wanted to run, but Mr. Nebbercracker held his shirt.

00:04:19.493 --> 00:04:21.976
Do you want to die?

00:04:22.036 --> 00:04:23.997
shouted Mr. Nebbercracker.

00:04:24.057 --> 00:04:24.938
No!

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.870
I love life!

00:04:26.929 --> 00:04:30.372
Mr. Nebbercracker pulled DJ's shirt.

00:04:30.432 --> 00:04:32.735
This is my house!

00:04:32.795 --> 00:04:33.856
He shouted.

00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:35.737
Stay away!

00:04:35.797 --> 00:04:41.583
The old man's face was very red and his eyes went big.

00:04:41.643 --> 00:04:45.848
Suddenly, he fell on top of DJ on the lawn.

00:04:45.908 --> 00:04:48.482
The old man didn't move.

00:04:48.542 --> 00:04:51.815
Oh, oh, said Chowder.

00:04:51.875 --> 00:05:01.486
Then there was a cold wind and the door closed loudly.

00:05:01.546 --> 00:05:07.732
Chapter 2.

00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:10.244
Come in.

00:05:10.304 --> 00:05:15.226
Some people came and took Mr. Nevercracker away.

00:05:15.285 --> 00:05:17.896
He's dead because of me.

00:05:17.956 --> 00:05:22.689
DJ said to Chowder, I feel terrible.

00:05:22.748 --> 00:05:26.290
Just then, Zee arrived in her car.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:30.241
She took her bag into DJ's house.

00:05:30.261 --> 00:05:31.712
Hi, she smiled.

00:05:31.772 --> 00:05:35.262
We're going to have a very good time.

00:05:35.321 --> 00:05:40.182
Mom and Dad aren't here, said DJ.

00:05:40.242 --> 00:05:42.804
Zee stopped smiling.

00:05:42.864 --> 00:05:51.040
Okay, she said, in the house at 9 o'clock, in your room at 11, no games.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.340
I'm not a child.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:56.823
Zee just looked at him angrily.

00:05:56.882 --> 00:06:00.404
Later, DJ was in his room.

00:06:00.464 --> 00:06:03.444
He looked at the house across the street.

00:06:03.504 --> 00:06:05.756
The house looked at him.

00:06:05.816 --> 00:06:08.038
He saw some smoke.

00:06:08.098 --> 00:06:10.980
It came out of the top of the house.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:16.084
Then there was a cold wind again and he closed his window.

00:06:16.143 --> 00:06:18.596
DJ went to sleep.

00:06:18.655 --> 00:06:21.848
He had a bad dream about the house.

00:06:21.907 --> 00:06:24.770
The house came into his room.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.164
It was big and dark.

00:06:27.224 --> 00:06:30.358
Then, the dark was a hand.

00:06:30.418 --> 00:06:32.160
It wanted to...

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.072
Suddenly, the phone woke him up.

00:06:35.131 --> 00:06:37.393
DJ looked at the number.

00:06:37.453 --> 00:06:39.244
He was frightened.

00:06:39.304 --> 00:06:42.867
The call was from Mr. Nevercracker's house.

00:06:42.926 --> 00:06:44.608
Who was it?

00:06:44.668 --> 00:06:47.540
Then, someone was in his room.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.104
Boo!

00:06:49.164 --> 00:06:53.138
It was Bones, Zee's boyfriend.

00:06:53.198 --> 00:06:55.419
Bones laughed at DJ.

00:06:55.479 --> 00:06:57.170
Zee was there too.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:00.521
It isn't funny, shouted DJ.

00:07:00.581 --> 00:07:05.313
Mr. Nebbercracker's dead and someone is in his house.

00:07:05.373 --> 00:07:06.584
Ooh!

00:07:06.644 --> 00:07:08.525
said Zee in Bones.

00:07:08.584 --> 00:07:10.315
They didn't believe him.

00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:13.242
They laughed and left his room.

00:07:13.302 --> 00:07:15.900
DJ looked at the house.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:19.132
One of the windows opened like an eye.

00:07:19.191 --> 00:07:21.864
DJ's heart went faster.

00:07:21.924 --> 00:07:24.296
The window closed again.

00:07:24.355 --> 00:07:26.928
DJ used his phone.

00:07:26.988 --> 00:07:30.320
police answered chowder.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:35.013
The danger zone said DJ, now.

00:07:35.073 --> 00:07:40.319
Bones told Z the story of his beautiful red kite.

00:07:40.379 --> 00:07:44.924
He was ten, and he loved that kite more than anything.

00:07:44.984 --> 00:07:50.286
Bones looked happy, but then his face changed.

00:07:50.346 --> 00:07:57.641
One day, the kite was high in the sky, but then it came down behind the houses.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.333
He found it on Mr. Nebbercracker's lawn.

00:08:01.392 --> 00:08:05.576
The old man shouted at him and took the kite.

00:08:05.636 --> 00:08:09.350
He's a terrible old man, said Z.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:11.531
Yeah, said Bones.

00:08:11.591 --> 00:08:13.162
And he's strange.

00:08:13.222 --> 00:08:15.264
He talked to the house.

00:08:15.324 --> 00:08:18.646
People say his wife died in that house.

00:08:18.706 --> 00:08:20.398
Did he eat your?

00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:23.690
He laughed, but Z was angry.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:27.523
She said, go home Bones.

00:08:27.583 --> 00:08:30.846
Bones went out of DJ's house.

00:08:30.905 --> 00:08:33.841
He looked at Mr. Nebbercracker's house.

00:08:33.901 --> 00:08:36.745
He threw a trainer onto the lawn.

00:08:36.805 --> 00:08:38.666
Nothing happened.

00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:41.537
Then he walked on the lawn.

00:08:41.597 --> 00:08:43.257
He waited.

00:08:43.318 --> 00:08:44.998
Nothing.

00:08:45.058 --> 00:08:47.370
He danced on the lawn.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.491
You are dead, he shouted.

00:08:50.551 --> 00:08:51.971
Look at me.

00:08:51.991 --> 00:08:53.952
I'm on your lawn.

00:08:54.012 --> 00:08:56.924
What are you going to do?

00:08:56.984 --> 00:09:03.731
Suddenly the door opened and Bones saw his lovely red kite.

00:09:03.791 --> 00:09:06.057
Bones followed it.

00:09:06.117 --> 00:09:10.400
The door closed and there was a terrible sound.

00:09:10.459 --> 00:09:14.062
Then it was quiet again.

00:09:14.122 --> 00:09:19.095
The danger zone was DJ and Chowder's special place.

00:09:19.155 --> 00:09:24.298
There was a very big crane and a digger and a lot of holes.

00:09:24.358 --> 00:09:28.530
Mr. Nevercracker is back from the dead, said DJ.

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.492
He wants to find me.

00:09:30.552 --> 00:09:32.984
I need your help, Chowder.

00:09:33.044 --> 00:09:39.658
The two boys left the danger zone, and soon they were in front of Mr. Nebbercracker's house.

00:09:39.718 --> 00:09:42.538
They saw a trainer on the lawn.

00:09:42.598 --> 00:09:44.799
The house watched them.

00:09:44.859 --> 00:09:47.490
Two windows opened slowly.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.210
Then nothing.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:54.582
Doosh's boring, said Chowder, and he went on to the lawn.

00:09:54.642 --> 00:09:55.752
Don't!

00:09:55.812 --> 00:09:57.539
shouted DJ.

00:09:57.599 --> 00:10:01.078
Suddenly there was a terrible sound.

00:10:01.138 --> 00:10:04.730
The door opened and the windows moved.

00:10:04.791 --> 00:10:07.853
They looked down angrily.

00:10:07.913 --> 00:10:12.608
Then the floor opened like teeth in a mouth.

00:10:12.668 --> 00:10:16.210
There was a big red open throat.

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:20.113
And then the carpet came out of the door like a tongue.

00:10:20.174 --> 00:10:26.568
The boys ran.

00:10:26.628 --> 00:10:35.714
Chapter 3 We don't believe you.

00:10:35.774 --> 00:10:40.516
The next morning a young girl came to the door.

00:10:40.576 --> 00:10:42.858
It was Jenny Bennett.

00:10:42.918 --> 00:10:46.880
You need some treats for tonight, she said.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.280
I'm selling chocolates.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:53.052
It's not my house, said Z.

00:10:53.112 --> 00:10:55.927
Okay, said Jenny.

00:10:55.987 --> 00:11:00.952
I'm sure the mom and dad left you some money for the trick or treaters.

00:11:01.012 --> 00:11:05.144
You give me $20 for some chocolates.

00:11:05.204 --> 00:11:08.446
I say you gave me $30.

00:11:08.506 --> 00:11:13.988
You keep $10 and you can have the chocolates too.

00:11:14.048 --> 00:11:16.869
Hey, you're good.

00:11:16.929 --> 00:11:20.010
Z gave Jenny the money.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.562
Z went to DJ's room.

00:11:23.622 --> 00:11:25.393
What are you doing?"

00:11:25.453 --> 00:11:26.964
she asked.

00:11:27.024 --> 00:11:31.785
Something in that house tried to eat us, said DJ.

00:11:31.845 --> 00:11:34.916
We stayed up all night to watch.

00:11:34.976 --> 00:11:39.157
You're so strange, said Z.

00:11:39.217 --> 00:11:41.507
Do you know where Bones is?

00:11:41.567 --> 00:11:44.888
He left last night and didn't come back.

00:11:44.948 --> 00:11:48.966
Didn't come back, said Jouda.

00:11:49.026 --> 00:11:56.458
Zee, I'm sorry, but the house took your boyfriend, said DJ.

00:11:56.518 --> 00:11:58.830
Zee didn't believe them.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.631
She closed her eyes.

00:12:00.691 --> 00:12:02.932
Please.

00:12:02.993 --> 00:12:06.394
She threw some chocolates to DJ.

00:12:06.454 --> 00:12:10.878
Breakfast, she said, and left the room.

00:12:10.938 --> 00:12:14.400
Chowder looked out of the window again.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.234
Oh, he said.

00:12:17.294 --> 00:12:19.158
DJ looked.

00:12:19.218 --> 00:12:20.878
It was Jenny.

00:12:20.938 --> 00:12:23.229
The boys watched her.

00:12:23.289 --> 00:12:25.810
They liked her red hair.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:31.042
They also liked her little nose and big clever eyes.

00:12:31.102 --> 00:12:33.662
Chowder looked at DJ.

00:12:33.722 --> 00:12:35.983
I saw her first.

00:12:36.043 --> 00:12:39.304
You can't say that, said DJ.

00:12:39.364 --> 00:12:42.216
Oh yes, I can.

00:12:42.276 --> 00:12:47.878
Jenny started to go to Mr. Nebbercracker's door with her chocolates.

00:12:47.938 --> 00:12:50.862
The boys ran out.

00:12:50.882 --> 00:12:51.182
No!

00:12:51.242 --> 00:12:52.603
they shouted.

00:12:52.662 --> 00:12:54.584
Jenny looked at them.

00:12:54.644 --> 00:12:56.856
Do you have a problem?

00:12:56.916 --> 00:12:58.616
She asked.

00:12:58.676 --> 00:13:01.969
Suddenly the windows opened.

00:13:02.029 --> 00:13:04.580
They were red and angry.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:11.246
Then a terrible cry came from the house and the lawn moved up and down.

00:13:11.306 --> 00:13:16.210
The door opened and the kids saw the mouth and the teeth.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:21.423
The carpet tongue came out and lifted Jenny up and down.

00:13:21.483 --> 00:13:26.416
It took the chocolates, but the boys pulled Jenny back.

00:13:26.476 --> 00:13:28.106
Hey!

00:13:28.166 --> 00:13:29.868
It was Z.

00:13:29.928 --> 00:13:33.029
The lawn and the house went quiet.

00:13:33.089 --> 00:13:35.050
The door closed.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:38.082
The eyes were windows again.

00:13:38.142 --> 00:13:42.584
I'm going to find bones and she went off.

00:13:42.644 --> 00:13:44.604
What's happening?

00:13:44.664 --> 00:13:46.301
asked Jenny.

00:13:46.361 --> 00:13:49.660
The boys told Jenny about the house.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.904
I'm very busy, said Jenny.

00:13:52.964 --> 00:13:57.791
But that house took my chocolate and tried to eat me.

00:13:57.851 --> 00:14:00.634
I can give you one hour.

00:14:00.694 --> 00:14:03.348
They all looked at the house.

00:14:03.408 --> 00:14:05.495
It was quiet now.

00:14:05.555 --> 00:14:08.010
Then they saw a dog.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.381
It walked onto the lawn.

00:14:10.441 --> 00:14:13.752
The door opened and the tongue came out.

00:14:13.812 --> 00:14:15.452
It took the dog.

00:14:15.512 --> 00:14:16.863
It was very quick.

00:14:16.883 --> 00:14:20.834
"'Call the police,' said Jenny.

00:14:20.894 --> 00:14:23.625
Suddenly DJ remembered.

00:14:23.685 --> 00:14:25.285
It's Halloween.

00:14:25.345 --> 00:14:30.336
Tonight there are going to be a lot of children at that door trick or treating.

00:14:30.396 --> 00:14:32.697
They're all going to die.

00:14:32.757 --> 00:14:38.038
Then the door opened and there was chowders ball.

00:14:38.098 --> 00:14:40.858
Suddenly the ball changed.

00:14:40.918 --> 00:14:44.779
Now it was a Halloween monster face.

00:14:44.839 --> 00:14:48.640
It's laughing at us, said Jenny.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:52.070
Then the police arrived.

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:55.051
There were two policemen.

00:14:55.111 --> 00:14:58.995
Landers was fat and had a pink face.

00:14:59.055 --> 00:15:02.169
Okay, what's happening?

00:15:02.229 --> 00:15:04.070
Lander's asked.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.650
The other policeman, Lister, was tall.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.391
He shouted at them.

00:15:09.451 --> 00:15:13.092
All of you, next to the car, now.

00:15:13.152 --> 00:15:16.954
He's new, said Lander's.

00:15:17.014 --> 00:15:21.845
There's something very bad in that house, Jenny told them.

00:15:21.905 --> 00:15:24.786
Someone died, said DJ.

00:15:24.846 --> 00:15:28.754
A dog died too, said Chowder.

00:15:28.814 --> 00:15:34.214
Landers smiled, but Lister shouted into the police radio.

00:15:34.274 --> 00:15:39.108
Dead dog, dead dog, we have a problem here.

00:15:39.168 --> 00:15:42.530
Landers took the radio away from him.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:45.062
Okay, you three.

00:15:45.122 --> 00:15:47.284
It's Halloween.

00:15:47.344 --> 00:15:49.185
We are busy.

00:15:49.246 --> 00:15:51.358
DJ tried again.

00:15:51.418 --> 00:15:53.469
Please believe us.

00:15:53.529 --> 00:15:55.800
The house has a mouth.

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:59.112
It pulls things in and eats them.

00:15:59.172 --> 00:16:02.684
See you later, said Lander's.

00:16:02.744 --> 00:16:04.325
Look!

00:16:04.386 --> 00:16:07.147
DJ walked onto the lawn.

00:16:07.207 --> 00:16:08.558
Nothing.

00:16:08.618 --> 00:16:10.700
He danced on the lawn.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:12.297
Nothing.

00:16:12.357 --> 00:16:13.834
Okay.

00:16:13.894 --> 00:16:15.264
said Lander's.

00:16:15.324 --> 00:16:16.905
We are going.

00:16:16.965 --> 00:16:19.576
Leave this house now.

00:16:19.636 --> 00:16:21.986
I'm going to give you ten.

00:16:22.006 --> 00:16:26.637
One, two, three.

00:16:26.697 --> 00:16:28.568
But we need your help.

00:16:28.628 --> 00:16:29.838
cried Jenny.

